    "description": "Explosion introduces \"Time Bomb - Prank Gun Sounds\", the prank simulator comes with the full package of realistic time bomb sounds and a crack screen. Especially many new add-in guns such as real guns, taser guns, light sabers. It's easy to troll anyone and make your phone more interesting than ever.\r\nThe latest main features of \"Time Bomb - Prank Gun Sounds\" and how to use them:\r\n\ud83d\udca3Time bomb\r\nMore than 10 types of time bombs to choose with very loud bomb explosion sounds to prank of your friend or family.\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Gun simulator:\r\nImmerse yourself in our extensive gun collection, from real guns to taser guns. Go for which gun you desire, and don't forget to try all the firing modes including Single, Burst Mode, Hold or Shake. The combination of authentic gun noises, the lighting effects, and the vibration is perfect for gun lovers.\r\n\ud83d\udd26Light saber:\r\nBegin the journey by selecting your favorite color. Then ready to jump in and shine your light saber.\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Crack screen\r\nPlay the crack screen feature and apply the screen you choose as a wallpaper. Passing this phone to others and scare them because of the thought of making your phone crack. Maybe you can even get a new phone LOL.\r\n\u26a0\ufe0fSOS, \"Time Bomb - Prank Gun Sounds\"  includes realistic weapons' sound and visual effects, BUT it's just a game/ prank app, NOT a real dangerous weapon. The \"Time Bomb - Prank Gun Sounds\" app serves entertainment purpose only and won't harm anyone or any device.\r\nDownload and enjoy all the pranks of  \"Time Bomb - Prank Gun Sounds\" \ud83d\ude06",
